  "description": "Luxury Meets Power. Built to Go Beyond\n\nBuilt for riders who demand more, the A9 Pro Max combines powerful performance, premium comfort, and all-terrain capability. With fat-tire traction, full suspension, and long-range power, it takes you confidently from city streets to open roads and beyond—giving you the freedom to ride farther and explore more.\n\nWith class-leading 270 Nm of torque and a top speed of 60 mph, the 3000W dual-motor system turns steep climbs into effortless rides and long-distance journeys into pure enjoyment. Ride farther, faster, and with greater confidence—every single time.\n\nDirect drive motors deliver pure, uninterrupted power straight to your application—no belts, gears, or complicated transmissions getting in the way. You’ll enjoy whisper-quiet operation, silky-smooth performance, and rock-solid precision that makes every task feel effortless.\n\nPowered by a massive 5,040Wh battery, every ride comes with the freedom to keep going. Experience extended journeys without constant recharging. Whether you're covering serious miles or simply taking the long way home, you have the power to explore farther with confidence.\n\nRide or drive confidently with a stable, protected battery. Its safe, smart BMS manages the battery well, keeps temperatures steady, and ensures reliable performance—reducing risks of over-discharge, overheating, or voltage problems in use.\n\nDual 300mm front brake discs and custom four-piston calipers deliver strong, responsive braking with improved heat dissipation—giving you confident control at high speeds and on demanding terrain.\n\nThe CBS braking system helps balance braking force between the front and rear wheels for smoother, more controlled stops. Whether slowing from speed or braking suddenly, it enhances stability and control—giving you greater confidence every time you ride.\n\nOversized 300 mm rear rotor paired with custom six-piston calipers deliver powerful, progressive stopping force and superior heat dissipation—giving you precise, fade-resistant control even under heavy loads, high speeds, or demanding terrain.",
